      "description": "Watch Konyaspor vs Rizespor highlights and goals from Süper Lig on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 15, 2026. The Süper Lig served up a tactical battle between Konyaspor and Rizespor , characterized by defensive resilience and high-stakes intensity. Both sides took to the pitch on 15 August 2026 , looking to make their mark in a contest that remained balanced for the majority of the duration. A Gritty Opening Period The match began with immediate physicality, as the referee was called into action early. Qazim Laci of Rizespor earned a yellow card in the 11th minute, setting the tone for a combative afternoon. Konyaspor attempted to establish dominance in the first half, but clear-cut chances were hard to come by against a disciplined visiting defense. After a lengthy period of stoppage time, the teams headed into the break with the deadlock still intact. Tactical Adjustments and Rising Tempers As the second half unfolded, both managers turned to their benches to find a breakthrough. A flurry of substitutions around the 68th minute saw Deniz Ertas , Blaz Kramer , and Marko Jevtovic enter for the hosts, while Rizespor introduced fresh legs in Ibrahim Olawoyin . The intensity boiled over as the clock ticked down, with Adedire Awokoya Mebude and Ali Sowe receiving cautions, leaving the result hanging in the balance as the match entered its final stages. Stoppage Time Chaos The game reached a fever pitch in the dying moments. In the 6th minute of added time, a confrontation led to yellow cards for Mithat Pala and Chidozie Awaziem . Amidst the tension, Rizespor was awarded a crucial penalty. Qazim Laci , who had been booked early in the match, stepped up to the spot in the 90+7th minute and calmly converted. That single goal proved to be the decider, securing a dramatic victory for the visitors just moments before the final whistle blew."
